<mxCell id="cell_2" value="AWS Enterprise Deployment Architecture with Native AWS Icons (North-to-South)
Defense-in-Depth: Network Core, DMZ BFF, Internal EKS Microservices, On-Prem Direct Connect &amp;amp; External SaaS/Registers" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#1E293B;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;rounded=1;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=25;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="30" width="2050" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cell_3" value="&lt;b&gt;AWS ICON CATEGORIES &amp;amp; INTEGRATIONS:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#8C4FFF; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;■ Networking:&lt;/span&gt; API GW, ALB, NLB, TGW, DXGW&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#ED7100; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;■ Compute:&lt;/span&gt; EKS, Lambda&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#7AA116; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;■ Storage:&lt;/span&gt; S3 Bucket&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#CC2264; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;■ Security:&lt;/span&gt; KMS, GuardDuty, Cedar&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#E7157B; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;■ Integration:&lt;/span&gt; SQS, EventBridge&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#2E27AD; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;■ Database:&lt;/span&gt; RDS, RDS Proxy&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#BE123C; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;― AEM SaaS&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#0891B2; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;― Dell ECS&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#6D28D9; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;― ForgeRock&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#1E3A8A; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;― nCore&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#B45309; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;― MAP/TIBCO&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#047857; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;― ABR&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&#x27;color:#0284C7; font-weight:bold;&#x27;&gt;― Salesforce&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10;rounded=1;shadow=0;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2130" y="30" width="950" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cell_4" value="&lt;b&gt;Web Browsers / End Users&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• HTTPS / TLS 1.3 (app.domain.com)&lt;br&gt;• NextJS SSR &amp; Client Fetch" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=56;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#334155;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="145" width="270" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
